{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10283300","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10283300","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1028330001:1":{"text":"Ah-choo! What's that smell? It's far too pungent!","source_cn":"阿——嚏！什么味道……太刺鼻了吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x606B14483ABB989B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1028330002:1":{"text":"Huh? ...Why are you all looking at me like that?","source_cn":"呃……你们怎么这么看着我？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x26ACDEB04ADC02E9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1028330003:1":{"text":"Gali! Great! You're finally awake!","source_cn":"伽利！太好了！你终于醒了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB2A9CF605916A91C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1028330004:1":{"text":"Didn't I... just drink the elixir? Why... am I a bit dizzy, as if I was just woken up in the middle of the night from a nice, long sleep?","source_cn":"我……刚才不是喝了灵药吗？怎么……有点头晕，像是睡到半...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC0E42856B35D68B1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1028330004":{"text":"Didn't I... just drink the elixir? Why... am I a bit dizzy, as if I was just woken up in the middle of the night from a nice, long sleep?","source_cn":"我……刚才不是喝了灵药吗？怎么……有点头晕，像是睡到半夜被突然叫醒一样……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC0E42856B35D68B1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1028330005:1":{"text":"But didn't I just drink an elixir of \"eternal youth?\" What gives?!","source_cn":"但我喝的不是永葆青春的灵药吗？到底是怎么回事？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC99BBD4F636AEA01","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1028330006:0":{"text":"How should I put it...?","source_cn":"该怎么说呢……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC958EB64D5A9CF03","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:9:1028330006":{"text":"How should I put it...?","source_cn":"该怎么说呢……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC958EB64D5A9CF03","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1028330009:1":{"text":"What? You mean in order for it to keep you young, it also has to keep you asleep?","source_cn":"什么？你是说，它用沉睡不醒的方式来让人“永葆青春”？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9C217BD86F45F68E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1028330010:1":{"text":"Ha, \"eternal youth!\"\nDevoid of ambitions and pursuits, all while sleeping motionless... what kind of youth is that??","source_cn":"哈，青春！\\n——没有激情、没有追求，一动不动睡在那里...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCCC87C031B5AB8F5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1028330011:1":{"text":"I would rather apply all my passion to archaeology, searching for eternal truths with a mortal life, than sleep for eternity!","source_cn":"比起沉睡的永恒，我宁愿为考古事业付出全部的激情——在有...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF5FF84990A6A0A0B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1028330012:1":{"text":"That's real \"eternal youth\"! At least for scholars, that is...","source_cn":"这才是真正的永葆青春！至少，对学者来说是这样的……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF9F608786381F884","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1028330013:1":{"text":"Well said! Gali, I can't help but applaud you. We disagree from time to time, but in this, we're on the same page.","source_cn":"说得好！伽利，我都忍不住想给你鼓掌了。咱们时常有分歧，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x20FBF7F4FC2F5A6A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1028330014:1":{"text":"However, you've just lost out on a \"major discovery\" from an ancient civilization.","source_cn":"不过这下，你就会少一个“上古文明的重大发现”了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x181BF4CD7930DCBD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1028330015:1":{"text":"As long as we maintain a passion for archaeology and the thrill of the chase, we will surely make the next \"major discovery\"!","source_cn":"只要有对考古事业的激情和追求，我们一定会有下一个“重大...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8F228EA5899D5CED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:17:1028330015":{"text":"As long as we maintain a passion for archaeology and the thrill of the chase, we will surely make the next \"major discovery\"!","source_cn":"只要有对考古事业的激情和追求，我们一定会有下一个“重大发现”的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8F228EA5899D5CED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1028330016:1":{"text":"Of course, our hunt for knowledge never ends!","source_cn":"当然，我们永远不会停下探求知识的步伐！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x53CD0DE00CD83812","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1028330017:1":{"text":"Perhaps when we next meet, we'll have something even more extraordinary to dazzle the academic community with.","source_cn":"也许下次见面时，我们就会有能被学界铭记的重大成果了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA3B444DE5C826FB3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1028330018:1":{"text":"Farewell, everyone, and thank you for your help!","source_cn":"再会啦，各位，谢谢你们的帮助！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9AD1579BDD5CA68C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:17:0:1":{"text":"Will you be leaving again?","source_cn":"你们又要走了？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x69FBDA90D4B55955","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Will you be leaving again?","female":"Will you be leaving again?","variant_male_record_index":"61296","variant_female_record_index":"61297","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:9:0:1":{"text":"So here's what happened...","source_cn":"解释“灵药”的功效","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x658CBE7FAA872ECB","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"So here's what happened...","female":"So here's what happened...","variant_male_record_index":"61294","variant_female_record_index":"61295","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:6:0:1":{"text":"You were sleeping. Quite well.","source_cn":"你确实睡得很香","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xFCDEEC8C4D2F28C1","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"You were sleeping. Quite well.","female":"You were sleeping. Quite well.","variant_male_record_index":"61290","variant_female_record_index":"61291","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1028330007:1":{"text":"What? Isn't this the elixir of \"eternal youth?\" I assure you my translation of the tablet was correct!","source_cn":"什么？这难道不是永葆青春的灵药吗？我保证我对石碑的翻译...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x42F5E341682172CB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1028330008:0":{"text":"Your translation was indeed correct, however...","source_cn":"你的翻译的确没错，但这药……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x11C677D1EA0FA7B4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:6:1:2":{"text":"The elixir induces deep sleep.","source_cn":"药的功能是让人沉眠","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x8728856CE67B067B","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"The elixir induces deep sleep.","female":"The elixir induces deep sleep.","variant_male_record_index":"61292","variant_female_record_index":"61293","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:伽利":{"text":"Gali","source":"伽利","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:梅丽莎":{"text":"Melissa","source":"梅丽莎","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":26,"localized_text_count":25,"speaker_count":2}}